Attribution

Warlord 2 is an original work built from scratch by LegendaryLionMan
in 2026. The game design is inspired by the 1990s 4X wargame
tradition (Warlords / Warlords II / Warlords III), but Warlord 2 does
not ship any art, music, code, names, lore, or other expressive
material from those works. All sprites, music, sound effects, and
prose are original; all faction and hero names are either generic
fantasy archetypes or newly coined. The procedural 16-colour palette is
inspired by the SVGA 16-colour tradition but is not byte-equivalent
to any specific historical palette file.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with
Strategic Simulations, Inc. (SSG), Ubisoft, or any other rights
holder of the original Warlords / Warlords II trademark. "Warlord 2"
is the name of this specific project and should not be confused with
any existing product.
